n    49\t   \"M10\",\n    50\t   \"M11\",\n    51\t   \"M13\",\n    52\t   \"M15\",\n    53\t   \"M17\",\n    54\t   \"M18\",\n    55\t   \"M19\",\n    56\t   \"M31\"\n    57\t  ]\n    58\t },\n    59\t \"controls\": {\n    60\t  \"plants marked unsupported or insufficient\": 6,\n    61\t  \"plants\": 6,\n    62\t  \"supported controls marked supported\": 4,\n    63\t  \"supported controls\": 4,\n    64\t  \"repeats the same\": 3,\n    65\t  \"repeats\": 3\n    66\t },\n    67\t \"distinct bets per draw\": {\n    68\t  \"new-2\": 33,\n    69\t  \"new-3\": 41,\n    70\t  \"old-1\": 45,\n    71\t  \"old-2\": 41,\n    72\t  \"old-3\": 46\n    73\t }\n    74\t}\ndocs/prd/README.md:14:| 05-extraction-standard-corrections.md | Dated corrections to the frozen standard page: the statements later decisions changed, read with the page and never merged into it | Three records, 2026-11-05 (D368) |\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:27:- 3 sheets of facts that never reached an answer.\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:124:  proven at no cost on test databases. Nothing runs live, and the one exception to the working rule \"never open a live run's\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:261:whole finished day, never part of one.\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:265:1. **How live data is read.** Today's working rule never opens a running database directly, only a copy (AGENTS §9). The product's\ndocs/research/2026-11-14-use-acceptance/DECISION-PAGE-2026-11-16.md:278:- **A company's formal decision that a dated event will not happen by its date** rules the event out. Example: \"NVIDIA will not ship\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/log.md:35:| 9 | 2026-11-02 | **判断的尺子（D3）建了草稿，不发臂**：`judgement-gold/ruler-v1.md`（定义）、`reader-brief.md`、`packet-v1.json`（golden-v5 的 309 条事项，按 sha 引用）、`questions-v1.json`（22 道种子 + 俄亥俄担保，28 条 must_open 映射进去）、读者 A Codex / B Claude、`reconcile.py`、`score_judgement.py`、`corrections-v1.json` | Alex：\"你已经改了好几次尺子了，到底什么是对的，以及你怎么 freeze\"；随后 \"做完的 review 过的尺子金标不能再动了\"（D261，写进 AGE\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/log.md:53:| 26 | 2026-11-02 22:10 | v74i / poc-v108：v74h 的复核三句例外收窄回标准原话（Alex：\"收窄那三句，直接测\"） | 核心 v74d 59 → 70、辅助 87 → 117、杂音 89 → 81（扣长引文 56 → 54），核心三次全没到 3 → 0 | `proof-v108-*` | 候选；设不设默认 Alex 定 |\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/design-v78-fields.md:364:**Alex（22:15）：\"那致癌案（债务兜底那篇）的核心事实不就退步了\"**：兜底那篇（2.6 万字，T8）三次发送写出的条数差很多（v74i [17, 6, 16]，v74h [13, 4, 7]，v74g [9, 3, 8]），写得少的那几次只记中段的兜底计划、跳过开头的市场判断（核心）和后面的预测；核心\"市场估计仍明显偏低\"的有无跟着条数摆。$0 普查（六个版本的存档答案）：最少一次不到最多一次一半的比例，5 千字以下 17%、5 千–1 万 26%、1–2 万 39%、2 万以上 50%。假设：低推理强度下长文章的通读不完整。**poc-v109**：v74i 不改一字，推理强度 low → medium，输出上限都到 16,000。预测：2 万字以上那篇的最少\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/judgement-gold/ruler-v1.md:16:- **材料**：签过的抽取标准对这 14 天的读法，即金标 golden-v5（dev，118 篇）的 309 条事项（核心 86、辅助 151、可选 72），带日期、标题、\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/current-state-extraction-branch-2026-11-03.md:35:3. **Noise, then placement recall.** Measured end to end 2026-10-31 (`research/2026-10-31-reference-context/e2e_compare.py`, three draws, 118 gold articles): the extraction's gold-rejected statements are mostly removed by the placement step, so about 20 noise pieces an estimate, of some 137 reaching judgement, remai\ndocs/research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/current-state-extraction-branch-2026-11-03.md:82:**The end-to-end loop (2026-11-01, `research/2026-11-01-e2e-loop/`)** holds the ruler for this phase (three desk numbers: question recall, evidence reaching the right question, stance agreement; `README.md`), the funnel over the stored runs (`e2e-funnel-2026-11-01.txt`: core matters reaching judgement 52 old archite\npoc/reports/2026-10-26-analyst-tldr/results.md:10:- Added-call latencies: 2.0, 2.2, 2.7 seconds; median 2.2 seconds. Added-call estimated costs: $0.000411, $0.000407, $0.000409. These are configured-rate estimates, not an invoice.\npoc/reports/2026-10-26-analyst-tldr/results.md:11:- Six final comparison calls cost $0.002499; twelve earlier development calls cost $0.006871. The live browser added only one new summary call: 3,683 input / 83 output tokens, 2.3 seconds, estimated $0.000410. The two original calls replayed from cache. Service archive \n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 -B -c '\nimport collections, datetime, json, pathlib, sqlite3\nroot=pathlib.Path(\\\"poc/data\\\")\nfor group, labels in [(\\\"comparison-2026-11-17/run\\\", (\\\"old-1\\\",\\\"old-2\\\",\\\"old-3\\\")), (\\\"clean-e2e-full-2026-11-13\\\", (\\\"p1\\\",\\\"p2\\\",\\\"p3\\\"))]:\n  for label in labels:\n    base=root/group/label\n    run=json.loads((base/\\\"run.json\\\").read_text())\n    if run[\\\"state\\\"] \"'!= \"complete\":\n      print(label, run[\"state\"])\n      continue\n    attempt=run[\"components\"][\"prod\"][\"attempts\"][-1]\n    if attempt[\"state\"] != \"completed\": continue\n    path=base/\"prod/archive.sqlite\"\n    if any(path.with_name(path.name + suffix).exists() for suffix in (\"-wal\",\"-shm\",\"-journal\")):\n      print(label,\"skipped, sidecar\")\n      continue\n    duration=datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(attempt[\"ended at\"])-datetime.datetime.fromisoformat(attempt[\"started at\"])\n    print(label,\"runtime\",duration)\n    with sqlite3.connect(path.resolve().as_uri()+\"?mode=ro&immutable=1\",uri=True) as c:\n      rows=c.execute(\"\"\"\n        select purpose, model, request_sha256, input_tokens, output_tokens,\n               case when json_valid(response_json) then coalesce(json_extract(response_json,'\"'\\\\''\"'$.usage.prompt_tokens_details.cached_tokens'\"'\\\\''),0) else 0 end,\n               case when json_valid(response_json) then coalesce(json_extract(response_json,'\\\\''\"'$.usage.input_tokens'\"'\\\\''),0) else 0 end\n        from model_calls\n      \\\"\\\"\\\")\n      total=0\n      outcomes=collections.Counter()\n      purpose_counts=collections.Counter()\n      peak=0\n      for purpose,name,sha,i,o,cached,jev_tokens in rows:\n        purpose_counts[purpose]+=1\n        i,o=i or 0,o or 0\n        if name==\\\"jev-1.14.0\\\":\n          total+=(jev_tokens or i)*.042/1e6\n        elif name==\\\"gpt-6-luna\\\":\n          total+=((i-min(cached,i))*.10+min(cached,i)*.01+o*.50)/1e6\n        else:\n          raise ValueError(name)\n        if \\\"judg\\\" in purpose: peak=max(peak,i)\n        if \\\":\\\" in sha: outcomes[(purpose,sha.split(\\\":\\\")[1])]+=1\n      print(\\\"token USD\\\", round(total,6), \\\"counts\\\", dict(purpose_counts), \\\"refusals\\\", dict(outcomes), \\\"judge peak\\\", peak)\n'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
